Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.75-rt108 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.75 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: 39b7680b6aae89467253097417b567229a711bea


Or to build 3.2.75-rt108 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.75.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.75-rt108.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
